    "updated_at": "2026-11-14T17:29:01Z",
    "body": "The fix is held locally at commit b94e2901 on issue/1495-wcs-local-turns.\nThe worktree is /home/mikekinney/CamcraftCodex/.claude/worktrees/issue-1495.\nThe cause is left composition of the quarter turn, which rotates about world axes.\nThe fix right-composes the turn and updates the page wording.\nquarter_turns_follow_each_oblique_setup_axis_in_both_directions failed before the fix and passes after it.\nRestoring upstream code makes the pin fail; restoring the fix makes it pass.\nThe quick gate and camcraft-ui all-targets clippy passed.\nNo NC or CL goldens changed.\nAutomatic approval review rejected the push because approval is required but this session's policy is Never.\nNo branch was pushed and no PR was created.\nReleasing this claim so the issue is free.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
